  "r:\"^Evolve the next activated <link\\=\"s\\|(\\d+)\"><u>Inspiration</u></link> to <link\\=\"s\\|(\\d+)\"><u>Imagination</u></link>\\. \\nImagination: Increase chance of counterattack to (\\d+)%, increase damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Defense, and change target to all foes\\. If the effect is not activated by Yusuke's next action, automatically activate it\\.\\nFor (\\d+) turns, gain a shield equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Yusuke's Defense \\+ <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>, increase Fire resistance, and nullify spiritual ailments\\.\\nAlso inflict <link\\=\"s\\|(\\d+)\"><u>Taunt</u></link> on all foes for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nCooldown Time: (\\d+) turn\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>His extaordinary artist's eye allows him to assess his surroundings, steeling himself\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
